---
// Illustrative storefront UI; the labels describe package capabilities, not client results.
---
<figure class="storefront-showcase" aria-label="Ilustrasi tampilan toko online dan pilihan alur pemesanan">
  <div class="showcase-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="showcase-tile tile-collection" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>THE DAILY ESSENTIALS</span>
    <img src="/blue-bag-editorial.webp" width="480" height="480" alt="" decoding="async" />
    <div>A little everyday blue.<span>↗</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-tile tile-catalog">
    <span class="tile-caption">STARTER STORE</span>
    <strong>Katalog rapi.</strong>
    <span>Produk mudah ditemukan.</span>
    <div class="catalog-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>

  <div class="store-phone" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="phone-camera"></div>
    <div class="phone-screen">
      <div class="demo-store-nav"><span>☰</span><strong>daily goods.</strong><span>♡</span></div>
      <div class="demo-store-photo">
        <img src="/fashion-editorial.webp" width="400" height="600" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
        <span class="demo-new">THE NEW COLLECTION</span>
        <div class="demo-store-title">Your everyday.<br /><i>Reimagined.</i></div>
      </div>
      <div class="demo-store-bottom"><div><span>Everyday Cotton Shirt</span><strong>Comfort in every detail.</strong></div><span class="demo-add">↗</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-tile tile-checkout">
    <span class="checkout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 7h16l-1 13H5L4 7Z"/><path d="M8 8V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2"/></svg></span>
    <div><span class="tile-caption">ONLINE STORE</span><strong>Siap checkout.</strong><span>Cart, pembayaran & pesanan.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-tile tile-message">
    <span class="tile-caption">ALUR STARTER STORE</span>
    <div class="message-preview"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p>Halo, produk ini<br />masih tersedia?</p></div>
    <div class="message-footer"><span class="message-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Pesan via WhatsApp</div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>Ilustrasi konsep toko online · desain disesuaikan dengan brand kamu</figcaption>
</figure>
